iamf-sentinel-mcp
Copyright 2026 The iamf-sentinel authors

An MCP server exposing the iamf-sentinel IAMF conformance validator and
the iamf-loom packager. The server layer is original work; conformance
and packaging logic live in the iamf-sentinel and iamf-loom packages
(both Apache-2.0), which this server invokes through their public APIs.

"IAMF" is used descriptively. "Eclipsa" is a trademark of its owner and
is not used in this project's naming.
